        "title": "Pass raw values or mutate shared state",
        "description": "Let scripts push bare JSON across an edge, or let both graphs read and write a shared store without a first-class handoff record.",
        "tradeoffs": "This is initially smaller, but hides schema and provenance, weakens port validation, makes replay and debugging ambiguous, and couples graph behavior to runtime state that is difficult to inspect or export.",
