        "title": "Approve and smoke-test the minimal envelope",
        "action": "Review the field names and v1 boundary. Then extend the canonical host/fragment smoke pair with one producer output and one receiver input. Send a typed text value, inspect the envelope and delivered result, then exercise schema mismatch and unresolved-destination rejection.",
        "expectedEvidence": "A user can see what was sent, where it came from, where it went, which contract validated it, and why it delivered or failed. No receiver state changes on rejection.",
